title: Parlament votes on Education Privatization
subtitle: The Catalan chamber, to make or break [? if education_minister_gender = "m": Conseller ?][? if education_minister_gender = "f": Consellera ?]of Education [+ education_minister +]'s proposal
view-if: education_privatization_introduced
tags: event
